      "author": "Rei Tanaka",
      "text": "STD's night window tonight is free; a dedup rerun fits it easily. Thursday's windows are already spoken for.",
      "ts": "2026-03-09T08:33:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Femi Oyelaran",
      "text": "The published snapshot must tie to Corin's statement before she signs. Any expedite fee to Bluecrest goes through Ingrid.",
